@startuml
title US-073 — Connect a Google account
hide footbox
actor "Student or tutor" as User
participant "Profile module\nExpo Web / Android" as Client
participant "CRM API" as API
participant "Google" as Google
database "SQL Server" as DB

alt Tutor
  User -> Client : Open /tutor/profile (Profile & security)
else Student
  User -> Client : Open /connect-google from student portal
end
Client -> API : POST /api/users/me/google/challenge\nCRM bearer token
API -> DB : Check active CRM account and save nonce for five minutes
API --> Client : 200 with nonce
Client --> User : Display official Google button
User -> Client : Select Continue with Google
Client -> Google : Google Identity Services or Credential Manager\nWeb Client ID and nonce
Google --> Client : Signed Google ID token with sub and nonce
Client -> API : POST /api/users/me/google\nCRM bearer token and Google ID token
API -> API : Verify Google token and read its sub and nonce
API -> DB : Consume matching unexpired nonce for CRM account
API -> DB : Check the CRM account is active
API -> DB : Store AccountId and verified GoogleSubject\nUnique constraint for each identifier
API --> Client : 204 No Content
Client --> User : Show confirmation on the current screen
@enduml
